! isp — simulated ISP / internet transit (Arista EOS)
!
! This node acts as the internet backbone, providing connectivity between
! the internet-client (attacker) and fw-outside (the enterprise WAN edge).
!
! Ethernet1: 203.0.113.1/30  facing internet-client
! Ethernet2: 203.0.114.1/30  facing fw-outside WAN
!
hostname isp
!
ip routing
!
interface Ethernet1
   description to internet-client
   no switchport
   ip address 203.0.113.1/30
   no shutdown
!
interface Ethernet2
   description to fw-outside WAN
   no switchport
   ip address 203.0.114.1/30
   no shutdown
!
end
